## Operation III

City of Locarno — public competition in Locarno (TI), Switzerland.

S. Lucignano SL 04 September 2026 ADVISO DI CONCORSO IL MUNICIPIO DI LOCARNO makes known that the competition for recruiting a: worker III indefinitely for the municipal team in the section of urban and sports spaces, public services. Employment rate 100% (40 hours per week). The function involves the execution of the following activities:
• To carry out, individually or in group, on indication and according to planning of the direct superior, activity of maintenance and/or cleaning of public infrastructures (roads, paths, fountains, banks, bus stops, baskets and containers of waste, road canals, pumping stations, small construction works, etc.) and of the territory (maintenance green areas/spheres, waste collection service, etc.);
• Perform other services according to the needs and/or ensure support to other sectors of the section, which fall within its competence;
• Take service in emergency situations, natural events (intemperies, salt spreading, snow clearing, etc.). General requirements:
• Good general state of health and good physical endurance;
• Good reputation, sense of responsibility and ease of contact with people;
• Good knowledge of the use of computer tools (cellular, tablet, PC);
• Dynamics, flexibility in the activities to be carried out, spirit of initiative and collaboration;
• License to conduct category B;
• Suitable for physical and outdoor work and for special activities (snow clearance, cleaning paths etc.);
• Availability for work outside time and holidays;
• Availability of continuing training (updating and continuing training);
• Knowledge of judicial territory. It is known that the position is already occupied by a collaborator in charge. Entry into service is scheduled on 1 December 2026. The first year will be considered trial period. The position is framed in the role of Operaio III in Class 3 (according to the Organic Regulation of Locarno Collaborators). The salary fork, for 100% use, starts from CHF 47’675.- up to a maximum of CHF 71’513.-, to which allowances for children must be added (CHF 2’580.-/CHF 3’216.-). 2 This notice of competition is also visible on the website of the City at the following address www.locarno.ch/it/albo-comunale/assunzioni-personale. The City Hall may not, in any case, consider applications and attachments transmitted through other channels (paper, email, fax, etc.) or incomplete applications. Applications must be submitted via the online portal by Friday, 25 September 2026, at 23:59 accompanied by the following documents:
• curriculum vitae
• letter of presentation with motivation to assume the function
• medical certificate or autocertification downloadable on www.locarno.ch - virtual door section - different forms
• diplomas or certificates of study and work
• photo passport size
• copy of identity document
• copy of work permit for persons of foreign nationality The extract of the judicial box and the certificate of the Office of executions and failures will be required when convening the selection interview. Any information can be requested directly to the Head of Urban and Sports Spaces, Mr. Stefano Lucignano: 091 756 32 11, e-mail: servizi.pubblici@locarno.ch. IL MUNICIPIO

Sector:* Public Administration

Sede: Piazza Grande 18, 6600 Locarno, TI, Switzerland

[Official basis (PDF)](https://www.locarno.ch/files/documents/Bando concorso operaio generico III (service urbani) 1.pdf)

